  "details": "This problem has only affected me recently. Any mouse movement VRChat captures causes the game to completely freeze. This happens during normal gameplay, during the menu display, and on the screen between worlds, and whether or not VRChat is the window in focus (as long as the mouse moves within the game screen's visible area). If I move the mouse in a continuous circle over the game, the screen will not update and audio will remain stalled for the entire duration of the mouse movement. The moment I stop moving the mouse, the game resumes drawing screen updates and audio unpauses. I have cleared my local cache and reinstalled the game to no avail.",
